  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police, through Bareskrim Polri, is conducting an active investigation into allegations of treason. As part of this inquiry, authorities previously questioned Budi Arie for nine hours, during which he reportedly addressed 42 questions from investigators regarding the case involving suspects like Listyo Sigit and others. Budi Arie stated that he was unfamiliar with most individuals implicated in the treason case, except for a person identified as LSP. Meanwhile, the investigation continues to expand, with police scheduling the examination of Devid Agus Yunanto, a former aide to former President Joko Widodo. Devid failed to appear for his initial summons, leading Bareskrim Polri to reschedule his appearance for November 30, 2026. These developments have drawn broader political commentary regarding the nature of the judicial proceedings and the specific allegations being investigated by the authorities.",
